Error [E0120]: `name` was not moved here, so it cannot be returned as-is
  --> tests/ui/return_borrowed_param.jet:1:35
    |
  1 | fn pick(name: String) -> String { name }
    |                                   ^^^^
 Why: This function has read access only and does not own the value
 Fix: Return a copy: `return ~name;` — or take ownership with the move marker `^`: `name: ^String`. To return borrowed data, declare `-> View<T> from name` and return a view derived from `name`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0120
